# RAG LLM configuration — ALL OPTIONAL.
#
# Without these variables, POST /api/chat still works and answers with a
# deterministic retrieval summary (mode=fallback). With them, answers are
# synthesized by any OpenAI-compatible chat endpoint (DeepSeek, OpenAI,
# Tongyi/Qwen, local Ollama, internal gateways, ...).
#
# Copy this file to `.env`-style exports in your shell; `.env` is git-ignored.
# Never commit real keys.
#
# Example for DeepSeek:
BANKING_KB_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
BANKING_KB_LLM_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here
BANKING_KB_LLM_MODEL=deepseek-chat
